@startuml
title Graderate State Transition Diagram

[*] --> WaitingState : [Start Date Not Arrived]

state "Waiting State" as WaitingState
WaitingState : entry / nil
WaitingState : do / wait for start date to arrive
WaitingState : exit / start date arrived or rate expired

WaitingState --> ActiveState : [Current Date >= Start Date]
ActiveState : entry / activate the rate
ActiveState : do / maintain active state until end of validity period
ActiveState : exit / finish date reached

ActiveState --> ExpiredState : [Finish Date Reached]

state "Expired State" as ExpiredState
ExpiredState : entry / mark rate as expired
ExpiredState : do / remove or archive the rate after one year from expiration date
ExpiredState : exit / rate removed or archived

ExpiredState --> [*] : [Rate Removed or Archived]
@enduml
